From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] apprt: edit scrollback in a terminal surface

#2504
#3496

Add a scrollback-editor command for opening text exports inside Ghostty.
A dedicated application action lets macOS and GTK temporarily replace the
current pane, restore the original surface when the editor exits, and remove
the exported directory without overloading URL handling.

Scrollback exports now include the visible screen, while alternate screens
export their active contents. Unsupported runtimes retain the existing
operating-system opener fallback.

